  "description": "\"Teacher, please marry me.\"   \n\"You're only twenty years old.\"   \nAt first, his voice held a laugh of disbelief, but it soon turned drier.    \n“For a first meeting in three years, today was… memorable. You think of me as trash who sleeps with his students? Don’t ever come to a place like this again. You could really end up with a truly trashy guy.”\n\nFirst school, last student.  \nThe girl who once asked him to see her not as a student but as a woman… had already become a woman.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12714728)\n\n[Original Novel](https://ridibooks.com/books/3863003498?_rdt_sid=keyword_finder_page&_rdt_idx=16)",
